# Vim setup #

- Paste the following contents in the .vimrc file in the $HOME.
- In windows use `:edit $MYVIMRC` or `vim _vimrc` in the $HOME folder.

```bash
syntax on
" Start region: rust plugin support
syntax enable
filetype plugin indent on
let g:rustfmt_autosave = 1
" End region: rust plugin support 
set fileformat=unix
set encoding=UTF-8

au BufNewFile,BufRead *.py
    \ set tabstop=4 |
    \ set softtabstop=4 |
    \ set shiftwidth=4 |

set tabstop=2
set softtabstop=2
set shiftwidth=2
set autoindent
set smartindent
set smarttab
set expandtab

set cursorline
set number
set scrolloff=8
set signcolumn=yes

set showcmd

set textwidth=79

set ignorecase
set smartcase
set incsearch
set hlsearch

set mouse=a

```
